BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260417T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260418T010000
DTSTAMP:20260417T230455
CREATED:20260330T154444Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260415T101928Z
UID:10053890-1776456000-1776474000@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Official Downtown After 5 After Party: Saving Shirley + Aden Webb
DESCRIPTION:Some bands play songs. Saving Shirley throws a full-blown party.\nBorn in the mountains of Western North Carolina\, this high-energy crew has built a reputation for turning rooms upside down with a setlist packed with pop\, rock\, and dance anthems from the 90s through the 2010s. Think Green Day\, The Killers\, Blink-182\, Rihanna\, Bruno Mars\, and plenty more. One minute the crowd is belting out Mr. Brightside\, the next the dance floor is packed and nobody remembers where they left their drink.\nSingalongs\, call-and-response chaos\, and the kind of energy that pulls people out of their seats and up to the stage. It is less of a concert and more of a “how did it get this wild in here” kind of night.\n\n\nSaving Shirley runs from 8pm to 11pm. Grab a cocktail\, keep the Downtown After 5 momentum going\, and don’t call it a night just yet.\n\nFrom 11pm to 1am\, Chris Vita takes it late with an acoustic set that trades the chaos for something a little more dialed-in. A Nashville-based singer-songwriter with roots in South Carolina\, Chris brings a mix of country influence and heartfelt storytelling shaped by years of writing and performing in Music City. The kind of set where you actually feel the songs.\nTwo vibes\, one night. Start loud\, end strong\n\n\n\nFitz\, she’s the party. Wolfe\, he’s the epicure. 2 levels\, 3 vibes. 🎶 Live Music |🍸Sips & Noms 🥪 | 🕹️ Artcade | 🗝️Speakeasy | Private Events \nFitz and the Wolfe is a cocktail and music venue shaped by the spirit of improvisation\, storytelling\, and the kind of nights that feel too good to end. Here\, every night brings a new soundtrack. Jazz\, swing\, honky-tonk\, and sometimes things a little more esoteric—if it moves people\, we book it. The music fills the space like a second heartbeat\, sometimes rowdy\, sometimes intimate\, always memorable. It’s not background noise. It’s the reason you’re here. fitzandthewolfe.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/saving-shirley-the-showroom/
LOCATION:Fitz and the Wolfe\, 1 Battery Park Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/669647182_1628747408896822_1940679808414869032_n-e1776248271471.jpg
GEO:35.5954515;-82.5548502
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Fitz and the Wolfe 1 Battery Park Ave Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1 Battery Park Ave:geo:-82.5548502,35.5954515
END:VEVENT
