SUMMARY:Mojarra
DESCRIPTION:Mojarra is a Shoegaze band from Western North Carolina. The band is defined by their giant guitar sounds\, stacked vocal harmonies\, and a dreamlike quality to their songwriting. Mojarra has two full-length albums released with a third on the way\, and will play mainly original music\, with a few covers in their signature style. \nShiloh & Gaines – Your neighborhood bar……no matter where you live. \nCoffee ~ Spirits ~ Pool ~ Darts ~ Live Music ~ Dog Friendly ~ Karaoke & More! Find our music schedule and more at shilohandgaines.com
